sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Seller
  participant I as Identity
  participant W as Verification worker
  participant KYC as KYC provider
  participant K as Kafka
  actor A as Admin
  S->>I: POST /sellers/applications (GSTIN, PAN, date, bank)
  I->>I: encrypt KYC inputs, seller PENDING_VERIFICATION
  I--)K: SellerApplicationSubmitted
  S->>I: connect DigiLocker
  I->>I: verification READY, SellerVerificationStarted
  loop every 2 s, picks due verifications
    W->>KYC: GSTIN, PAN, penny drop, DigiLocker identity
    KYC-->>W: results with registry names
    W->>I: store seller_verification_checks
  end
  alt every check passes and names match
    I->>I: seller APPROVED by SYSTEM, grant SELLER role
    I--)K: SellerApproved
  else a check fails (attempt 1 to 3)
    I-->>S: which check failed and why, correct and retry
  else still failing or provider down after retries
    I->>I: seller UNDER_REVIEW
    A->>I: POST /admin/sellers/{id}/decisions (MFA, reason)
    I--)K: SellerApproved or SellerRejected
  end
  Note over I,K: Catalog builds its verified_seller_projection from these events. Audit records each step.
